### IPP-1004 Admin users API tests
### Put ADMIN_PASSWORD from server/.env while testing, then put CHANGE_ME back

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = askedin143@gmail.com
@adminPassword = CHANGE_ME
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@userId = {{search.response.body.data.users[0]._id}}


### 1. Admin login -> expect 200
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }


### 2. All users (newest first, 20 per page) -> each has quizCount and lastQuizAt
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 3. Search -> expect the +ipp2 test user (its id is used below)
# @name search
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?search=ipp2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 4. Filters -> paid | free | blocked | unverified | admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?filter=unverified
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 5. Bad filter -> expect 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?filter=vip
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 6. Block -> expect 200 "... is blocked"  (the user now gets 403 when logging in)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isBlocked": true }


### 7. Unblock -> expect 200 "... is unblocked"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isBlocked": false }
